-- want_report.md --
govulncheck found 2 vulnerabilities; this PR fixes 1, 1 needs manual attention:

**[GO-2020-0017](https://pkg.go.dev/vuln/GO-2020-0017)**: Authentication bypass in github.com/dgrijalva/jwt-go

    github.com/dgrijalva/jwt-go v3.2.0+incompatible -> v3.99.0+incompatible (upgrading breaks `go mod tidy`, needs manual attention)

**[GO-2021-0113](https://pkg.go.dev/vuln/GO-2021-0113)**: Denial of service in golang.org/x/text

    golang.org/x/text v0.3.5 -> v0.3.7
